  "ruleText": "Jus 602.23 “Personal Injury” means death or corporeal or mental health damage suffered as a result of an eligible crime.\n\nSource. #9553, eff 9-25-09, EXPIRED: 9-25-17\n\nNew. #12938, eff 12-9-19 (formerly Jus 602.20)",
